The file is unmodified: 7776 words, one dice roll and one word per line.
SHA-256 of this file is pinned in app/js/passphrase.js.

Matripuntos suggests passphrases from this English list. A Spanish list was not vendored. The Spanish lists in circulation are under the GNU Free Documentation License with cover texts, or they do not state a license clear enough to ship inside this MIT program. This notice keeps the organizational copyright of the English list.
